    "heading": "Extended Spell",
    "lineStart": 4063,
    "lineEnd": 4069
  },
  "section": "3.270",
  "rulesText": "Cost: 1 Sorcery Point\n\nWhen you cast a spell that has a duration of 1 minute or longer, you can spend 1 Sorcery Point to double its duration to a maximum duration of 24 hours.\n\nIf the affected spell requires Concentration, you have Advantage on any saving throw you make to maintain that Concentration."
}
